void(0)\" title=\" 4th-3rd c.BC: Zeno Citieus Stoicus 1.18. \">Refs 4th c.BC+</a>]","G20348":"<b> ἐνάρμ-οστος</b>, ον, <br /> <b>harmonious</b>, συμφωνίας [<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" title=\" LXX.4Mac.14.3 \">LXX</a>]; <b>concordant</b>, πρὸς ἄλλα [<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" title=\" 4th c.AD: Iamblichus Philosophus “de Mysteriis” 3.18. \">Refs 4th c.AD+</a>]","G20349":"<b> ἐνᾰτεν-ίξω</b>, <br /> <i>future</i> -ιῶ Crates[<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" title=\" “Ep.” 15 \">Refs</a>]:— <b>fix steadfastly on</b>, τὰς ἀκοάς τινι [<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" title=\" 4th c.AD: Iamblichus Philosophus “de vita Pythagorica” 15.65; τὸ πρόσωπον εἰς.. 2nd c.AD: Soranus Medicus 1.70. \">Refs 2nd c.AD+</a>]<br /><Level2><b>__II</b></Level2> <i>intransitive</i>, <b>look fixedly on</b> one, [<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" title=\" LXX.3Mac.5.30, 3rd c.AD: Heliodorus Scriptor Eroticus 7.7, “PMag.Leid.W.” 5.44; ἐ. δριμὺ καὶ τιτανῶδες 4th c.AD: Libanius Sophista “Declamationes” 51.10: with _dative_, [ἡδοναῖς] Cratesl.c.; ἡλίῳ 2nd c.AD: Sextus Empiricus Philosophus “Πυρρώνειοι ὑποτυπώσεις” 1.45, compare 5th c.AD: Syrianus Philosophus et Rhetor “in Metaphysica commentaria - Comm. in” 45.16; διαγράμματι 4th c.AD: Iamblichus Philosophus “in Nicomachi arithmeticam introductionem” p.88 P. \">LXX+2nd c.AD+</a>]","G20350":"<b> ἐνδείκ-της</b>, ον, ὁ, <br /> <b>informer, complainant</b>, [<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" title=\" “UPZ” 69.4 (2nd c.BC), LXX.2Mac.4.1, 2nd-3rd c.AD: Philostratus Sophista “Vitae Sophistarum” 2.29. \">LXX+2nd c.BC+</a>]","G20351":"<b> ἐνδελεχ-έω</b>, <br /> <b>continue</b>, with <i>accusative</i>, μάστιγάς τινι [<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" title=\" LXX.Sir.30.1 \">LXX</a>]:—<i>passive</i>, <b>to be persistently afflicted</b> with a malady, [<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" title=\" 7th c.AD: Stephanus Medicus “in Hp.” 1.136D. \">Refs 7th c.AD+</a>]","G20352":"<b> ἐνδελεχ-ίζω</b>, <br /> ={ἐνδελεχέω}, <b>persevere</b>, ἐν φιλοσοφίᾳ [<a href=\"javascript:vo